  "_comment": "Evidence for telling official Tibia from other games in Twitch's Tibia category, following the 2026-10-21 audit (research/twitch/data/2026-10-21/analysis). Text is normalized (accents, lookalike letters, fancy fonts, leetspeak, repeated letters, spaced-out letters) and every match becomes a weighted signal for 'other' or 'tibia'. Signals of one side combine with diminishing returns (strongest + half the next + a quarter the next...), so weak context words never decide alone. A side wins when it reaches decision.threshold and leads by decision.margin; otherwise the stream stays undetermined (visible). Words before a mention can weaken it (negation, leaving, comparison, another time). Official tags count half against a server named in the title. The generic 'Tibia' tag proves nothing.",
